# Credentials for the gt NTRIP re-casters.  NOT IN GIT.
#
# Install to ~/opt/ntrip-relay/relay.env, mode 0600.  The units reference these
# as ${VAR} so no secret ever appears in a unit file, a journal line, or `ps`.
#
# Same rule as ntrip.conf and timelab/antennas.json: secrets and survey
# coordinates stay out of BOTH repos, public and private.  A private repo is
# still a repo.

# igs-ip.net — observation streams (PTBB, BRUX)
IGS_USER=your-igs-ip-username
IGS_PASS=your-igs-ip-password

# products.igs-ip.net — SSR correction products (SSRA03IGS0)
PRODUCTS_USER=your-products-username
PRODUCTS_PASS=your-products-password

# Onocoy — only needed to ACTIVATE onocoy-obs-transcode.service.
# The credential NAME is the NTRIP username.  See onocoy-activation-README.md.
#ONOCOY_USER=your-onocoy-credential-name
#ONOCOY_PASS=your-onocoy-credential-password
